<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.3000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.3000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.3000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Monday after 75.0000 on Friday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Apr 7		   Apr 4</p>
<p> High			     75.3000		 75.0100</p>
<p> Low				75.2500		 74.9000</p>
<p> Open			     75.3000		 74.9799</p>
<p> Close			    75.3000		 75.0000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	     7.870		   7.190</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
